# CSS / Tailwind

## Edit vs generated

| File | Action |
|------|--------|
| `css/tailwind.css` | **Edit** — `@layer components`, design tokens |
| `css/main.css` | **Never hand-edit** — run `npm run build:css` |
| `tailwind.config.js` | Brand tokens / `content` globs only when needed |

After any style or class change used in HTML: rebuild and commit `css/main.css`.

## Brand tokens (preserve)

- Canvas: `#111111` (`background`)
- Accent: `#10b981` (emerald)
- Surfaces / text: as in `tailwind.config.js`
- Fonts: Inter (sans), JetBrains Mono (mono)
- Dark theme + glassmorphic header patterns already in use

## Extending UI

Prefer existing component classes (`.btn-primary`, `.card`, `.section-*`, `.form-*`, `.nav-*`, `.hero-*`) via `@apply` in `tailwind.css`.

Do not enable unused Tailwind plugins in `tailwind.config.js` (`plugins: []` today) without a clear need — deps may exist but are not wired.
